{"sections":[{"slug":"K3曲面","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"K3曲面"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"“K3 <span lang=\"zh\">曲面</span>”"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"“K3 曲面”"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p>K3 <span lang=\"zh\">曲面</span> $X$ <span lang=\"zh\">是复</span> $2$ <span lang=\"zh\">维紧流形</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">其</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/典范丛","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">典范丛</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">平凡</span> (<span lang=\"zh\">即</span> $\\omega_X \\simeq \\mathcal{O}_X$), <span lang=\"zh\">且</span> $H^1(X,\\mathcal{O}_X)=0$ (<span lang=\"zh\">或</span> $H^{1,0}(X)=0$).\n<span lang=\"zh\">其典范丛平凡也可表述为典范类</span> ("},{"Local":{"url":"/陈类","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">陈类</span>"}},{"Plain":") $K=-c_1(T_X)=0$, <span lang=\"zh\">其中</span> $T_X$ <span lang=\"zh\">是</span> $X$ <span lang=\"zh\">的全纯切丛</span>.</p>\n<p>K3 <span lang=\"zh\">曲面最早由</span> Kummer <span lang=\"zh\">研究</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">根据</span> Weil <span lang=\"zh\">的记载</span>, K3 <span lang=\"zh\">曲面的命名是为了纪念</span> Kummer, Kahler <span lang=\"zh\">和</span> Kodaira.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">所有</span> K3 <span lang=\"zh\">曲面互相微分同胚</span>.</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">代数簇</span></h2>\n<p>$k$ <span lang=\"zh\">上的</span> <strong>K3 <span lang=\"zh\">曲面</span></strong><span lang=\"zh\">是指</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/紧合","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">紧合映射</span>"}},{"Plain":" (proper) <span lang=\"zh\">的</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">光滑的</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">几何连通</span> (geometrically connected) <span lang=\"zh\">的</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">满足</span> $H^1(X,\\mathscr O_X)=0$ <span lang=\"zh\">的</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/Calabi--丘","text":"Calabi–<span lang=\"zh\">丘流形</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">曲面</span>.</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">例</span></h2>\n<p>$\\mathbb P^3$ <span lang=\"zh\">中一般的四次曲面是</span> K3 <span lang=\"zh\">曲面</span>.</p>\n<p><strong><span lang=\"zh\">证明</span></strong>. $K \\simeq K_{\\mathbb P^3} \\otimes \\mathcal O_{\\mathbb P^3}(4) \\simeq  \\mathcal O$.</p>\n<h3>Kummer <span lang=\"zh\">构造</span></h3>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">考虑</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/Abel曲面","text":"Abel <span lang=\"zh\">簇</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">商掉</span> $\\pm 1$ <span lang=\"zh\">的作用</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">爆破所有</span> 16 <span lang=\"zh\">个不动点</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">见</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/Kummer曲面","text":"Kummer <span lang=\"zh\">曲面</span>"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n"}]}}}]}